      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Kazuma Okamoto finished 7th in voting for the AL Rookie of the Year Award, receiving one third-place vote. #BlueJays",
      "likes": 34,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-10T01:11:37.677Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzwb3dvyac2e",
      "jp_players": [
        "Kazuma Okamoto",
        "Okamoto"
      ],
      "jp": "岡本和真はア・リーグ新人王の投票で7位。3位票を1票獲得した。#BlueJays"
    },
    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "There is only one Pat Murphy. He’s getting his lower body put back together after grinding through the 2026 season in pain, and he’s doing the Manager of the Year Award show on MLB Network from his hospital bed. 🤣",
      "likes": 113,
      "reposts": 13,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-11T00:38:36.138Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:idooavtb3a4mlluqclqzel5p/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzypp7n5g22y",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "パット・マーフィーは唯一無二の存在。2026年シーズンを痛みに耐えて戦い抜き、下半身の手術を受けた今も、病院のベッドからMLB Networkの最優秀監督賞の発表番組に出演している🤣"
    },
    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Kevin McGonigle is the American League Rookie of the Year. He is the first Tigers hitter to win the award since Lou Whitaker in 1978.",
      "likes": 100,
      "reposts": 17,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-10T00:24:54.885Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:ug2irz5m3k7nlbpiggqc73wt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzw6hsxkoc2w",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ケビン・マクゴニグルがア・リーグ新人王に。タイガースの野手が選ばれるのは1978年のルー・ウィテカー以来。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Happy release day to Hazel Mae! Buy yourself a copy, then buy five more to begin your Christmas shopping. A huge accomplishment, and I'm thrilled for Hazel. Indigo link: www.indigo.ca/products/bef...",
      "likes": 69,
      "reposts": 10,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-10T17:16:26.681Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzxwyl6eks2n",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ヘーゼル・メイさんの発売日、おめでとう！まず1冊買って、さらに5冊買ってクリスマスの買い物を始めよう。大きな偉業で、心から嬉しい。Indigoの販売ページあり"
    },
    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "More on the elite company in which Pat Murphy finds himself after winning a third Manager of the Year Award (with a history lesson from @SlangsOnSports). www.mlb.com/brewers/news...",
      "likes": 56,
      "reposts": 6,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-11T01:03:46.816Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:idooavtb3a4mlluqclqzel5p/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzyr4ad72226",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "最優秀監督賞を3度受賞したパット・マーフィーが並んだ顔ぶれについて。@SlangsOnSports による歴史の解説つき。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Kevin McGonigle received 28 of 30 first-place votes from BBWAA members (two per chapter in AL cities), with Cleveland's Parker Messick getting the other two.",
      "likes": 29,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-10T00:30:05.390Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:ug2irz5m3k7nlbpiggqc73wt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzw6r33fac2w",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ケビン・マクゴニグルはBBWAA会員（ア・リーグ各都市は2票ずつ）の1位票30票中28票を獲得。残る2票はクリーブランドのパーカー・メシックだった。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "Cubs right-hander Ben Brown's surgery Sunday involved inserting a screw in his neck to stabilize the stress fracture and get blood flow to the area. \"Hopeful we get 100% of Ben Brown next year once he gets healthy and hopefully put some of these neck issues behind us,\" GM Carter Hawkins said today.",
      "likes": 20,
      "reposts": 7,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-11T00:12:32.253Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzyoam6x5224",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "カブスの右腕ベン・ブラウンは日曜に手術。疲労骨折した首を固定し血流を確保するため、スクリューを埋め込んだ。カーター・ホーキンスGMは「回復すれば来年は100%のベン・ブラウンが戻ってくると期待。首の問題も解消できれば」と語った。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Detroit's Kevin McGonigle received 28/30 first-place votes to win AL Rookie of the Year. Parker Messick finished second and received two first-place votes.",
